<title>USA: Aristo Intl names Glenn Sblendorio CFO.</title>
<headline>Aristo Intl names Glenn Sblendorio CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aristo International Corp said it appointed Glenn Sblendorio chief financial officer of the Internet entertainment company.</p>
<p>Sblendorio was senior vice president and chief financial officer of Sony Interactive Entertainment, a unit of Japan's Sony Corp.</p>
<p>It could not immediately be determined if the chief financial officer post were newly created.</p>
</text>
